      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Cost per minute (list price)",
      "description": "Estimated USD per minute at the price table's list prices; the free tiers cost $0. The dashed line is the cost-spike alert's threshold: 3x the 24 h average.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 28,
        "w": 8,
